#: ../../tools/interpro_entry_tools.rst:32 2d6d551f449d4c9a84fe8768b65dc5d2
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get all InterPro domain and family entries annotated on "
"a specific protein. Performs a reverse lookup from a UniProt protein "
"accession to all InterPro entries (domains, families, homologous "
"superfamilies, conserved sites) that have been detected on that protein. "
"Example: P04637 (TP53) has 9 InterPro entries including IPR002117 (p53 "
"family), IPR011615 (p53 DNA-binding domain), IPR010991 (p53 "
"tetramerisation domain), IPR013872 (p53 transactivation domain)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/interpro_entry_tools.rst:34
#: ../../tools/interpro_entry_tools.rst:65 59147c361f904c9dbf660de64d0aa4db
#: c2fbcaf8e82947b2a3d47fccf71aba6c
msgid "**Parameters:**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/interpro_entry_tools.rst:36 954cf9c49c894c8cb5e8776ea233adb5
msgid ""
"``accession`` (string) (required) UniProt protein accession. Examples: "
"'P04637' (TP53, 9 entries), 'P00533' (EGFR), 'P01308' (Insulin), 'P38398'"
" (BRCA1)."
msgstr ""

